            THE USE OF THE SOFTWARE, TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl mb-4">8. General</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray leading-relaxed mb-0">
            This license is governed by the laws of Italy, and the courts of Milan, Italy have exclusive jurisdiction.
            If a provision is held unenforceable, the remaining provisions stay in effect.
            This license, together with any separate written agreement between you and Sveltos, is the entire agreement about the Software.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-lg text-gray leading-relaxed mb-0">
          Questions: <a href="mailto:support@projectsveltos.io" class="text-primary font-semibold">support@projectsveltos.io</a>
        </p>

      </div>
    </Section>
  </main>
</Layout>
